{"phase": 2, "item": 5, "kind": "brief", "box": "g7e.12xlarge 2xRTX_PRO_6000_Blackwell_ServerEdition_96GB drv595.71.05 cuda13.2", "title": "spec/MTP over PP-2", "status": "not built (per don't-sink-days)", "why": "the deferred window's 1.905x needs token t+1 enqueued before token t's logits land; plain autoregressive decode structurally cannot, but spec ALREADY has the next K tokens. Only arm where the measured 1.9x is reachable in real single-stream serving.", "blocking_dependency": "verify is a batched forward of K+1 tokens -> requires the batched trunk to be stage-split first (bill item 1). Spec cannot ship before that.", "open_experiment": "draft placement: MTP layers map to the LAST stage today (pp::new_cache trailing rule) = boundary hop per draft token but natural draft/verify overlap; draft-on-stage-0 = local drafting but serializes vs the trunk. Not measured.", "also_needed": "stage-fan-out accept/rollback (accept decided at last stage where the lm head is, rollback touches every stage's KV)", "gate_required": "run-spec K=1..8 over the door + PP-2 vs 1-GPU accepted-token-stream identity"}
